Categoria Energética: B

NEW THREE-BEDROOM APARTMENT IN AVEIRO - COMFORT, QUALITY AND MODERNITY

Three-bedroom apartment with a total gross area of 182.22 m², parking for two cars, a balcony measuring 7.85 m², a storage room measuring 3.57 m² and construction solutions designed to enhance thermal comfort and energy efficiency.

New-build property featuring:

- One en-suite bedroom;

- Two additional bedrooms;

- Three bathrooms;

- Open-plan living room and kitchen;

- Fully fitted kitchen equipped with Bosch appliances;

- Balcony measuring 7.85 m²;

- Storage room measuring 3.57 m² in the basement;

- Parking spaces for two vehicles, with a total area of 24 m²;

- Pre-installation for photovoltaic panels and electric vehicle charging;

- Modern finishes;

- Air conditioning;

- Thermal-break window frames;

- Double glazing.

A property designed to provide quality of life, functionality and well-being in every moment.

Discover this excellent apartment in a newly built multi-family residential building located in Aveiro.

Featuring contemporary architecture and a functional layout, this property has been designed to meet the demands of modern living, offering comfortable, bright and welcoming spaces.

The living room and bedrooms feature luxury vinyl plank flooring, suspended plasterboard ceilings and white lacquered wooden joinery, creating an elegant and harmonious atmosphere.

The kitchen is equipped with Bosch appliances, including an oven, microwave, hob, extractor hood and dishwasher.

Thermal comfort is enhanced by external ETICS insulation (External Thermal Insulation Composite System), aluminium window frames with thermal breaks, double glazing, and electric, automated thermal shutters.

Climate control is provided by a Bosch air conditioning system, while domestic hot water is supplied by a Termobrasa heat pump.

The apartment also benefits from private parking spaces in the basement, providing added convenience and security.

The building also includes pre-installation for photovoltaic panels and electric vehicle charging.

An excellent opportunity to purchase a brand-new apartment in Aveiro, combining high construction standards, comfort and forward-thinking solutions.

